<b>Acquisition of Scott &amp; Fetzer</b>

     Right after yearend we acquired The Scott &amp; Fetzer Company=20
(=93Scott Fetzer=94) of Cleveland for about $320 million. (In=20
addition, about $90 million of pre-existing Scott Fetzer debt=20
remains in place.) In the next section of this report I describe=20
the sort of businesses that we wish to buy for Berkshire.  Scott=20
